{\info{\title Internal Information Security Policy \u8212? 2025}{\author Seeky SDC}}
\viewkind4\uc1
\pard\b \f0\fs22 Information classification\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Internal standard code: POL-2025-0096.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Information is classified as public, internal, confidential, or restricted according to the impact of improper disclosure.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Disposal requires dual confirmation and produces an immutable audit record.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 This standard is reviewed annually or after a material risk change.\par
\pard\b \f0\fs22 Access management\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Exceptions must be documented, justified, and approved by the responsible director.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 Backups are verified monthly through a restore test.\par
\pard\f0\fs22 This policy applies to every team handling Gamma Group information at the Seattle site.\par
\pard\li360 \f0\fs22 Test continuity plans at least once a year.\par
\pard\li360 \f0\fs22 Encrypt removable media with organisation-managed keys.\par
\pard\li360 \f0\fs22 Name an owner for every document repository.\par
}
